{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XxGTK5jKzAwosF95AG7wH7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tSome notes from me (Ines)\n2\t\n3\tPictures I have:\n4\t- about 60 photos of dishes and the jar wall, taken by Priya Nair for the\n5\t  restaurant's website\n6\t- my own phone photos of the larder, labels and all\n7\t- scans of all four issues of Brine (drawings by my friend Olu)\n8\t- a photo of my grandmother's ogiri pot\n9\t\n10\tThings people ask me about: the jar wall, the koji room (it is a cupboard),\n11\tthe staff meal, and the workshops I run on the first Monday of the month.\n12\t\n13\tI took over the kitchen in September 2022.\n14\t\n15\tBooks that got me here: The Art of Fermentation by Sandor Katz, and Wild\n16\tFermentation. And my grandmother, who never measured anything.\n17\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c2d15a00-3735-4dcc-b3b9-bc51cda185ae","uuid":"2e67efdc-9877-4351-852e-db2673e6037f","timestamp":"2026-10-10T04:46:53.433Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"material/notes.md","content":"Some notes from me (Ines)\n\nPictures I have:\n- about 60 photos of dishes and the jar wall, taken by Priya Nair for the\n  restaurant's website\n- my own phone photos of the larder, labels and all\n- scans of all four issues of Brine (drawings by my friend Olu)\n- a photo of my grandmother's ogiri pot\n\nThings people ask me about: the jar wall, the koji room (it is a cupboard),\nthe staff meal, and the workshops I run on the first Monday of the month.\n\nI took over the kitchen in September 2022.\n\nBooks that got me here: The Art of Fermentation by Sandor Katz, and Wild\nFermentation. And my grandmother, who never measured anything.\n","numLines":17,"startLine":1,"totalLines":17}}}
